Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeWetRoadWithReflections" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 .

:weather1 a :NightCondition, :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Wet road surface causing reduced traction and increased stopping distance" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reflections on wet road surface may obscure visibility of distant objects" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Unusual light reflections may distract the driver" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.45"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Wet road surface causing reduced traction and increased stopping distance
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 2:**
Description: Reflections on wet road surface may obscure visibility of distant objects
Severity Score: 0.60

**Risk 3:**
Description: Unusual light reflections may distract the driver
Severity Score: 0.45

---
The scene is classified as a **StateAnomaly** due to the anomalous state of the road conditions (wet surface and reflections) rather than any anomalous behavior or evidence-based anomaly. The primary risks identified are related to the road conditions, occlusion, and potential distraction from the reflections.